            "description": {
              "value": "Certain magics in the world flow easily through your sap. You can cast barkskin and tree shape as 2nd-level arcane innate spells once per day each. A tree shape spell you cast this way transforms you into a Large flowering plant like a rosebush or lilac bush instead of a tree."
            }
